          %p
            The
            %a{:href => "http://nlab.mathforge.org/nlab/show/cohesive%20(infinity,1)-topos#deRhamCohomology"} coefficient object for intrinsic de Rham cohomology
            is
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
