          .num_remark
            %h6#remark Remark
            %p
              The restriction to single representatives in each de Rham class is a reflection of the fact that in the above
              = succeed "-pullback" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
