          %h3#CircleBundlesConnection Circle bundles with connection
          %p
            Before discussing
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "#DeligneCohomologyTheorem"} the full theorem
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi n
                  %mo =
                  %mn 1
