            by an ordinary pullback in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sSet"} sSet
            we also want to resolve the curvature characteristic morphism
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
