                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbf{B}U(1) \to \mathbf{\flat}_{dR} \mathbf{B}^2 U(1)
            by a fibration. We claim that this may be obtained by choosing the resolution
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                    %mi B
                  %mi U
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mn 1
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
