          %p where the restriction to the top morphism is the underlying cocycle and the restriction to the bottom morphism the curvature form.
          %p
            The generalization to such diagram cocycles from
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msup
                    %mi b
                    %mrow
