                  \\simeq
                  \\left\{
                  P  : \mathbf{B}^n U(1) | \exists F \in \Omega^{n+1}_{cl} . curv(P) = F
                  \\right\}
                  \\,.
          %p
            Spelled out this expresses
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
